 r←Test_Misc_20(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;T2;rc;log
⍝ In batch mode a `GoToTidyUp` check that passes must not add a line number to the report
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 #.⎕SHADOW'Temp'
 'Temp'#.⎕NS''
 T2←⎕NEW ##.Tester2 #.Temp
 #.Temp.T←T2
 #.Temp.⎕FX'r←Test_01(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP' '⍝ Last check passes' 'r←T._Failed' '→T.GoToTidyUp 0' 'r←T._OK' '∆TidyUp:'
 (rc log)←T2.RunBatchTests 0
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf∨/'Last check passes'⍷∊log
 →T.PassesIf~∨/'Last check passes ['⍷∊log

 r←T._OK
